flowchart LR
    E[Evidence verification records] --> S{Verification evidence standard}

    S -->|strict| StrictCount{At least 5 Verified Supervisors?}
    StrictCount -->|no| StrictRetry[Bounded alternate-source retry or recoverable stop]
    StrictCount -->|yes| Fit[Evaluate evidence-backed Research Fit]

    S -->|identity_only_mvp| Identity[Require directly grounded identity]
    Identity --> MvpCount{At least 3 identity-verified Supervisors?}
    MvpCount -->|no| MvpRetry[Bounded retry or recoverable stop]
    MvpCount -->|yes| Fit

    Fit --> Synthesis[Propose up to 5 Verified Supervisors]
    Synthesis --> Review{{Candidate review}}
    Review -->|approve explicit IDs| Persist[Persist Shortlisted Supervisors]
    Review -->|reject or request more| Refine[Record feedback and refine]
